vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">B站发布2026年Q1财报：实现扭亏为盈，AI驱动广告收入增长30%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱发布GLM-5.1高速版API，实现400 tokens/s推理速度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，智谱正式面向企业客户推出GLM-5.1高速版API（GLM-5.1-highspeed）。该模型在保持旗舰级基座能力的同时，实测输出速度达到400 tokens/s，刷新全球大模型API速度上限。产品支持200K超长上下文窗口，最大单次输出达128K tokens。智谱通过与TileRT团队深度合作，在推理引擎层重写核心路径，并引入动态批处理与KV Cache调度优化，实现了“旗舰级能力”与“极致低延迟”的并存。该模型现已通过智谱MaaS平台向特定企业客户定向开放。此举旨在解决Coding Agent、实时语音交互及多智能体并行推演等高频场景下的延迟瓶颈，助力企业在部署复杂Agent系统时无需在智能水平与响应速度间进行妥协，加速软件生态向Agentic时代升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校研究证实：GPT-4.5在图灵测试中胜率超越真人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/69056aa44007a63af553be961b3a49ab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校（UCSD）在《美国国家科学院院刊》（PNAS）发表研究，证实大语言模型已能通过经典图灵测试。实验显示，在特定人格提示词加持下，GPT-4.5被判定为人类的胜率达73%，显著超越真人志愿者；开源模型LLaMa-3.1-405B胜率达56%，与人类表现持平。研究发现，AI胜出的关键在于模拟人类的幽默感、易错性及社会行为特征，而非单纯的逻辑计算。若失去人格提示，GPT-4.5胜率降至36%。研究者指出，AI已成为“完美的说谎者”，这标志着图灵测试从衡量智能转向衡量“像人程度”。该成果引发行业对网络信任链断裂的担忧，专家警示，AI伪装技术易被滥用于欺诈、操纵舆论或窃取隐私，未来必须加速部署更严苛的数字身份验证与AI内容防伪机制。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29f544e819c801a31e134d098bfbc4a8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，OpenAI 正式推出 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件（Beta版），该插件已嵌入 PowerPoint 底层架构，面向全球所有 ChatGPT 用户（含免费版）开放。用户可通过 PowerPoint 插件商店搜索并激活使用。该插件支持三大核心功能：一是通过自然语言指令一键生成包含大纲与布局的完整 PPT；二是实时响应文案润色与配色调整需求；三是具备“主动揪 Bug”能力，能识别内容逻辑缺口并预判汇报提问。为确保安全性，插件引入了“人在回路（Human-in-the-loop）”机制，针对结构大改等关键操作强制要求人工确认。此次原生接入打破了传统 AI 工具需“复制粘贴”的割裂体验，标志着办公生产力工具从手动操作转向“AI 智能体协作”模式，用户角色转变为负责拆解大纲与把控逻辑的</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Comscore发布2026年3月美国桌面端消费级AI聊天机器人市场报告，全美AI平台独立用户达4440万，环比增长超21%。ChatGPT以3386万独立访客稳居榜首，环比增长18.9%；Gemini以1066万访客位列第二，环比增长29.1%；微软Copilot以502万访客位居第三，环比增长44.4%。Anthropic旗下的Claude表现最为抢眼，以266万独立访客位列第四，环比增速高达130.1%，成为市场格局中的核心变量。榜单后三位分别为X Grok（165万）、DeepSeek（41万）及Perplexity（36万）。数据表明，尽管头部梯队优势明显，但以Claude为代表的后方梯队正通过高增长迅速缩小差距，桌面端AI市场的竞争格局正趋于激烈，用户对多元化AI工具的渗透率持续提升。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">B站发布2026年Q1财报：实现扭亏为盈，AI驱动广告收入增长30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0719dd169958cbdcab8edffc93903fb7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">B站发布2026年第一季度财报，总营收达74.7亿元，同比增长7%，净利润实现2.02亿元，正式扭亏为盈。核心增长引擎广告业务收入达25.9亿元，同比激增30%，连续13个季度保持双位数增长。AI技术成为商业化核心变量，自动广告消耗渗透率已达85%，显著提升投放转化效率。用户端，DAU达1.15亿，日均使用时长创下119分钟的历史新高。尽管游戏业务受高基数影响同比下滑12%，但公司明确了长线运营战略，并计划年内上线《三国志：王道天下》等新品。管理层强调AI是历史性机遇，未来将持续加大AI基建投入，预计全年增加10亿元相关资本开支，以巩固技术驱动增长的盈利周期。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
